ArchBang Classic - Openbox keybindings

Super + Return          Terminal (lxterminal)
Super + Space           Launcher (rofi drun)
Alt + F2                Run command (rofi run)
Super + w               Firefox
Super + e               File manager (thunar)
Super + m               Openbox menu
Super + l               Lock screen (slock)
Super + q / Alt + F4    Close window
Super + f               Toggle maximize
Super + d               Show desktop
Super + Left / Right    Snap window to half screen
Super + 1-4             Switch desktop
Super + Shift + 1-4     Send window to desktop
Alt + Tab               Cycle windows
Print                   Screenshot to ~/

Mouse
Right-click desktop     Openbox menu
Middle-click desktop    Window list
Alt + drag              Move window
Alt + right-drag        Resize window
